  "created": "2021-10-09T13:36:19.549Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm aware this can be changed in the config but would it be possible to have toggles for different photo resolutions ingame, perhaps on the menu below the camera where the filters etc. are? Presets for 1080p, 2k, 4k would probably be the common ones people would want.\nAdditionally it might be nice to be able to change these presets in the config if you want more unusual resolutions.",
